### ============================================================
### Task endpoints — require a valid JWT
###
### 1. Run "Login" below to get a token
### 2. Copy the token value
### 3. Paste it into @token below
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_YOUR_JWT_HERE

### ---- Get a fresh token ----

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dave@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ---- Protected endpoints ----

### Create a task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write README",
  "description": "Add setup instructions",
  "dueDate": "2026-02-01"
}

### List my tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write README",
  "description": "Updated",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "dueDate": "2026-02-01"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401 test — no token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks

### 401 test — invalid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here